{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993380/extras/6b35e9c6dd4cc805f64dacfd85a5f2ec.avif?t=1768437568\" width=1560 height=878 /></span>Embark on an intergalactic adventure in <strong>StarBuddy</strong>, a colorful side-scrolling 3D platformer with a fresh twist. After your tiny spaceship enters a mysterious universe, your brave little hero sets out on a mission: <strong>rescue the adorable fluffy creatures</strong> and bring them safely back to their home planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level hides <strong>three unique fluffies</strong> in red, yellow, and blue. These lively creatures feel like vibrant versions of your white little hero, and it\u2019s up to you to find and rescue them all. Once you gather every fluffy, hop back into your spaceship and travel to the next world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you\u2019ll face a variety of enemies: colorful aliens, crawling robots, flying drones, and even factory machines that endlessly spawn enemies\u2014until you shut down their production lines. Defeat them by <strong>jumping on their heads, blasting with your tiny blaster, or even unleashing a bazooka</strong> for maximum puff!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From lush green fields to scorching deserts, neon-lit cities, icy snowlands, and beyond\u2014every stage offers a unique challenge and atmosphere. Keep an eye out for <strong>colorful balloons</strong> floating around; some carry hidden rewards to aid your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993380/extras/4a55f6d02bf907da347d45a5c13a8c0a.poster.avif?t=1768437568\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993380/extras/4a55f6d02bf907da347d45a5c13a8c0a.webm?t=1768437568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993380/extras/4a55f6d02bf907da347d45a5c13a8c0a.mp4?t=1768437568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2b50 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Fresh Platforming Gameplay</strong> \u2013 A side-scrolling 3D platformer with depth and new mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Rescue the Fluffies</strong> \u2013 Collect the red, yellow, and blue companions in every level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Dynamic Combat</strong> \u2013 Jump on foes, blast with a blaster, or fire a bazooka</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993380/extras/496f5f98030d971b167270c54e774322.poster.avif?t=1768437568\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993380/extras/496f5f98030d971b167270c54e774322.webm?t=1768437568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993380/extras/496f5f98030d971b167270c54e774322.mp4?t=1768437568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd16 <strong>Challenging Enemies</strong> \u2013 Colorful aliens, ground robots, flying drones, and enemy factories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Diverse Worlds</strong> \u2013 Explore forests, deserts, cities, icy landscapes, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf88 <strong>Secrets &amp; Rewards</strong> \u2013 Pop colorful balloons to discover hidden surprises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Level Progression</strong> \u2013 Gather fluffies, return to your ship, and journey to the next adventure</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993380/extras/acb5be3193d67fe928c68f487f18db8e.poster.avif?t=1768437568\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993380/extras/acb5be3193d67fe928c68f487f18db8e.webm?t=1768437568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993380/extras/acb5be3193d67fe928c68f487f18db8e.mp4?t=1768437568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993380/extras/cbe8cd37713b4238ae7d0aba18cbd3f3.poster.avif?t=1768437568\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993380/extras/cbe8cd37713b4238ae7d0aba18cbd3f3.webm?t=1768437568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993380/extras/cbe8cd37713b4238ae7d0aba18cbd3f3.mp4?t=1768437568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3993380?t=1768437568","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3993380?t=1768437568","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993380/decb2826153b5afed42534b31c2193ea92b19a7a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768437568","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993380/d